@base = http://localhost:5082
@ticketId = SUBSTITUA-PELO-ID-RETORNADO

### Abrir chamado
POST {{base}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Impressora sem conexão","description":"Não responde na rede.","priority":"High"}

### Iniciar atendimento
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"InProgress"}

### Comentar
POST {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{"message":"Verificando rede."}

### Resolver
PATCH {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"status":"Resolved"}

### Histórico
GET {{base}}/api/tickets/{{ticketId}}/history

### Filtrar
GET {{base}}/api/tickets?status=Resolved
